    "detailed_description": "Zombie jokers 2 is an arcade game where you have to survive in different locations with zombie ! You can improve the speed of your character, as well as buy him a more powerful gun! Each time, the number of zombies increases. In the game you will have to shoot different zombies.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe game has:<br />\r\n1) Several variations of weapons. (Starting with pistols ending with a machine gun)<br />\r\n2) The ability to equip the player in armor.<br />\r\n3) The ability to pump player's characteristics. (Dexterity, speed, immunity)<br />\r\n4) With each time zombies become more aggressive.<br />\r\n5) Your equipment also affects the speed of your player!",
